          "stream": false,
          "system": [
            {
              "text": "## SubAgent Delegation\n\nYou have access to a `task` tool for delegating work to specialized SubAgents.\n\n**Use SubAgents when:**\n- Task is complex and multi-step\n- Task can be fully delegated in isolation\n- You only care about the final result\n- Heavy context/token usage would benefit from isolation\n\n**Do NOT use SubAgents when:**\n- Task is trivial (single tool call)\n- You need to see intermediate reasoning\n- Task requires iterative back-and-forth\n\nSubAgents have their own conversation context and will work independently\nto complete the task. You will receive only their final result.\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "temperature": 1.0,
          "tools": [
            {
              "description": "Delegate a task to a specialized SubAgent.\n\nAvailable SubAgents:\n- general-purpose: General-purpose subagent for complex, multi-step tasks. Inherits all tools and middleware from parent agent. Use when you need to delegate independent work that can run in isolation.\n- researcher: Research facts and answer questions",
              "input_schema": {
                "properties": {
                  "instructions": {
                    "description": "Detailed instructions for what the SubAgent should accomplish. Be specific about the task, expected output, and any context needed.",
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "subagent_type": {
                    "description": "Which specialized SubAgent to use for this task",
                    "enum": [
                      "general-purpose",
                      "researcher"
                    ],
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "system_prompt": {
                    "description": "Optional custom system prompt to define how the SubAgent should behave. Only applicable for 'general-purpose' type. Defines role, capabilities, and constraints. If omitted, a default general-purpose prompt will be used.",
                    "type": "string"
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "instructions",
                  "subagent_type"
                ],
                "type": "object"
              },
              "name": "task"
